### `fs`

* Type: `FileSystemAdapter`
* Default: A default FS methods

By default, the built-in Node.js module (`fs`) is used to work with the file system. You can replace any method with
your own.

```ts
interface FileSystemAdapter {
	lstat: typeof fs.lstat;
	stat: typeof fs.stat;
